From 4cc8250b3e132943f51f4baa96e2a66bcafe923b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 09:38:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] rc/httpd/webui: v1.3.0 - Traffic Analyzer (rtrafd collector +
 native page: per-device/per-network/per-class history, top talkers, quota,
 WAN probe, RAM/JFFS/USB storage)

New in-tree daemon rtrafd (release/src/router/rtrafd/, no listening port):
- Samples every 30s from clean sources only (DPI stack stays removed):
  /proc/net/dev (WAN + per-br* network), /proc/net/nf_conntrack (per-client
  bytes + live top talkers, LAN-attributed via lan_ipaddr/mask + /proc/net/arp),
  tmctl getqstats (per-QoS-class, only while HW classful runs), and an opt-in
  ping probe (WAN latency/loss; empty target = no outbound).
- Four ring granularities per series (5min x288/24h, hour x336/14d, day x366,
  month x24) published as JSON under /tmp/rtraf for the authed endpoint.
- Storage backend chosen by nvram rtraf_path (rstats_path-style): "" = RAM
  (cleared on reboot), "jffs" = internal flash, "usb" = /tmp/mnt/*/reaper;
  hourly snapshot, atomic rename, unwritable target falls back to RAM.
- Monthly quota (rtraf_cap_gb): syslog WARNING at 80% and 100% (reaches a
  remote SIEM via the existing remote-syslog path); notification only.
- Enables nf_conntrack_acct sysctl so flows carry byte counters.
- Wired: router Makefile obj-y + install rule; rc start_rtraf/stop_rtraf on
  boot (start_services) + service dispatch ("rtraf") + stop_services; rc.h
  protos; defaults.c rtraf_enable/path/probe/cap_gb.

httpd: do_reaper_traffic_cgi + reaper_traffic.cgi (do_auth) streams the
requested window snapshot; window name matched against a fixed 5-literal
allowlist so the served path is never request-controlled.

www: NEW Reaper_Traffic.asp dashboard-native page - live tiles, 5 time
windows (live/24h/14d/1y/month), WAN throughput lines with optional latency
overlay, stacked per-class + per-network areas, top-devices table, live
top-talkers by destination-port bucket (the no-DPI replacement for per-app),
monthly-cap meter, JSON export, and a Settings panel exposing the storage
backend + probe + cap, plus a usage/FAQ fly-out. Chart series use a
CVD-validated categorical palette (dataviz validator, dark surface: all six
checks pass) for the stacks; brand crimson/jade/amber carry WAN up/down/
latency. Menu Traffic-Analyzer tab + dashboard rail retargeted (stock
Monitor/Statistic pages still ship, reachable by URL); reaper_inject.c +
reaper_shell native-marker skip the page.

Mock-validated render. EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.3.0. Metal tests owed: rtrafd
runs (ps), per-client numbers accrue with fc accel ON (the conntrack-acct
sync question), JFFS/USB persistence survives reboot + RAM fallback, quota
syslog fires at 80/100%, per-class chart populates under HW classful, probe
latency graphs, export downloads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
